{{Quote|Wielded by the [[Tide Keeper|keeper of tides]], a spear that controls water with the power of a dragon.|Item}}
The '''Dragon Trident''' is a {{Rare}} [[sword]].

The Dragon Trident is a decent pick due to its [[Area of Effect|AoE]] and ease. It is also somewhat easy to get due to being obtainable in [[Second Sea]]. 

It is best suited for grinding, as its '''[X] Water Dragon Shower''' is an un-true [[stun]].

==Obtainment==
The Dragon Trident can be dropped by the [[Tide Keeper]].

